# m0 traces are tens of megabytes each, so they stay out. results do not: a
# report cannot be regenerated without both the trace and a multi-gigabyte model
# download, so ignoring it would leave progress.md and the decision records
# citing numbers with no artefact behind them. a few hundred kb is cheaper than
# an unfalsifiable claim.
m0/traces/

